tmrGame.Tick              ' F, once
tmrGame.Tick              ' held: not again
Form.KeyDown F            ' the system's repeat, a KeyDown while held: not again
tmrGame.Tick
Form.KeyUp F
Form.KeyDown F
Form.KeyUp F              ' a tap between two ticks counts once
Form.KeyDown G
Form.KeyDown OemPeriod
