Form.KeyUp G
Form.KeyUp OemPeriod
Form.KeyDown F
Form.KeyUp F
btnTwice.Click            ' asked twice: True, then False
Form.KeyDown G
Form.KeyUp G
btnClear.Click            ' ClearPressed forgets G
tmrGame.Tick
Form.KeyDown F
Form.KeyUp F
btnAsk.Click              ' a MsgBox opens: F is forgotten
OK
